  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "はしりまわって　たいおんを　あげると\nほのおエネルギーが　からだを　めぐり\nほんらいの　ちからを　はっきできる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "뛰어다니며 체온을 높이면\n불꽃 에너지가 몸 안에 맴돌아\n본래의 힘을 발휘할 수 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "不斷奔跑使體溫升高後，\n火之能量會在牠體內循環，\n促使牠發揮出真正的力量。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il court pour augmenter sa température et faire\ncirculer l’énergie incandescente dans son corps.\nIl peut ainsi déployer toute sa puissance.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Erhöht es durch Rennen seine Körpertemperatur,\nströmt Feuer-Energie durch seinen Körper. Dann\nkann es seine wahre Kraft entfesseln.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se pone a correr para elevar su temperatura\ncorporal y propagar la energía ígnea por todo\nel cuerpo. Desata así su verdadera fuerza.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quando corre, la sua temperatura corporea sale\npervadendolo di un’energia infuocata che gli\npermette di scatenare la sua vera potenza.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "A warm-up of running around gets fire energy\ncoursing through this Pokémon’s body. Once that\nhappens, it’s ready to fight at full power.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "走りまわって　体温を　上げると\n炎エネルギーが　体を　巡り\n本来の　力を　発揮できる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "不断奔跑使体温升高后，\n火之能量会在它身体循环，\n促使它发挥出真正的力量。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se pone a correr para elevar su temperatura\ncorporal y propagar la energía ígnea por todo\nel cuerpo. Desata así su verdadera fuerza.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "たたかう　じゅんびが　ととのうと\nはなの　あたまと　あしの　うらの\nにくきゅうが　こうねつを　はっする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "싸울 준비가 되면\n코끝과 발바닥의\n볼록살에서 고열을 낸다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "一旦做好了戰鬥的準備，\n牠鼻頭上和腳底的肉球\n就會散發出極度的高溫。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quand il est prêt à se battre, la partie\nqui surmonte son museau ainsi que les coussinets\nde ses pattes postérieures émettent de la chaleur.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ist es kampfbereit, verströmt es von seiner\nNasenspitze und von den Ballen an seinen\nLäufen Hitze.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando se prepara para combatir, irradia calor\npor la punta de la nariz y el pelo que le recubre\nlas patas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quando si prepara a lottare, la punta del naso\ne i cuscinetti sotto le zampe irradiano calore.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It has special pads on the backs of its feet, and\none on its nose. Once it’s raring to fight, these\npads radiate tremendous heat.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "戦う　準備が　整うと\n鼻の　頭と　足の　裏の\n肉球が　高熱を　発する。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "一旦做好了战斗的准备，\n它鼻头上和脚底的肉球\n就会发出极度的高温。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando se prepara para combatir, irradia calor\npor la punta de la nariz y el pelo que le recubre\nlas patas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ぜんしんが　あたたまることでほんらいの　パワーを　はっきできる。そのため　じゅんびうんどうを　する。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "전신이 따뜻해지면 본래의 힘을 발휘할 수 있다. 그러기 위해 준비 운동을 한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "當全身的溫度提升後，就會發揮出真正的力量，因此會為此做熱身運動。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon peut déployer tout son potentiel une fois que sa température est élevée. C’est pourquoi il fait des exercices d’échauffement.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Erst wenn sein Körper ausreichend warm ist, kann es seine wahre Kraft entfesseln. Deshalb macht es Aufwärmübungen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Desata su verdadera fuerza cuando su cuerpo entra en calor. Por eso hace ejercicios de calentamiento.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quando la temperatura corporea sale, sprigiona tutta la sua potenza. Perciò fa sempre esercizi di riscaldamento.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Once its body has heated up, Scorbunny can use the full extent of its power. That’s why it does warm-up exercises.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "全身が　温まることで本来の　パワーを　発揮できる。そのため　準備運動を　する。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "通过提升全身的温度，便能发挥出真正的力量。它会为此而做准备运动。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Desata su verdadera fuerza cuando su cuerpo entra en calor. Por eso hace ejercicios de calentamiento.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
